==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Olga (Enemy)|Olga]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

